:"","ucode":"94656FE4A6C378","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/15/69/187b9968.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1562301232,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"电脑集显，玩古老的传奇都会卡顿。以此推断出可以对2D进行加速～","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":109803,"user_name":"若失","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1509383,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8EA12E988C0852","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eoib6BjEV4KPEaibP0MSA3f9VA21H2h4P8uIaatDqW7krBqJF6YH136TCNKGSbERHscOIEp0TlYlcbw/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1562115872,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"终于讲到GPU，希望老师多讲一些这方面的内容，对于游戏开发者来说深入了解底层硬件知识还是很重要的！","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":210391,"user_name":"WENMURAN","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1915404,"ip_address":"","ucode":"5D1CE8B41937C7","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eqXNhbTULKiakib8lYXrvGF2zPwfedooBzC2EtSv1nt1MwV1KUvTkcJrvCBFvcdwJicnr3OEXnk9GUCg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1587734895,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"GPU:图形处理器\n我们电脑显示的3D图形是通过多边形组合出来的。图形的移动和变化都是计算机根据图形学通过实时计算渲染出来的。渲染过程的步骤:1顶点处理，把三维的点转换成二维的。2，图元处理，把顶点转换之后的其他点连接成多边形。3，栅格化，把连接成的多边形进行栅格处理（像素）。 4，片段处理，计算每一个像素的颜色透明度信息，给像素点上色。5，像素操作，把不同像素点混合在一起。\n计算量大，CPU计算能力不够，占用资源太多，只用硬件来进行图形渲染。只有顶点处理用CPU计算，后续都由显卡完成。","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":109883,"user_name":"宋不肥","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1240126,"ip_address":"","ucode":"32B34AF579C91C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/ec/3e/885ec1d2.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1562124591,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"GPU主要靠硬件并行来加速图形处理，不管2D还是3D图像处理，本质上都是大规模的矩阵运算，应该都可以加速","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":332827,"user_name":"Kitty🐱婷🎉","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2336798,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DD9DF7F0F9E3AB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/23/a8/1e/a04cbc6c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1643703230,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"2D里由于z = 0，所以就不需要图元处理里的 剔除和剪裁 这个步骤了，其他对图形渲染的步骤与3D一致。 不知道我的理解对不对","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":273275,"user_name":"Bruce","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2403865,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2EA3B9DBF5821C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/ae/19/5f2d96ce.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1610520964,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"3D模型会有一个基于多边形建模的三维图形的渲染过程。那手机拍照的时候需不需要这个渲染过程的，就是说静止的图片，要这个3D图形渲染过程吗？感觉手机咔嚓一下就拍照好了。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2204439,"avatar":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DD1fMrD3TSuPGsVyUiaI6iaicPY2bRb0VgcFERAiaJ6pMPk3LkmAibgdX17z8oP3Pk6bOqY3mIsmuaY79RWFvOen6Jw/132","nickname":"Geek_36fda6","note":"","ucode":"B467E4A3BC4D1B","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":405812,"discussion_content":"图片不用3D渲染，但是手机也需要玩3D游戏，需要显卡。","content_length":27,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1634649600,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":119518,"user_name":"水能载舟","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1510237,"ip_address":"","ucode":"E2F59A99363001","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/0b/5d/c05da54e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1564621243,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"老师请问，OpenGL 的运行是否要求计算机一定要有图形卡模块，哪怕是集成显卡，是不是没有显卡模块就无法运行","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":393794,"user_name":"Mamba","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1475049,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"8B3EC90736B8EB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/81/e9/d131dd81.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1724912665,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"虽然显卡可以加速2D图形处理，但并不是所有的2D图形操作都会自动由显卡加速。开发者需要确保他们的应用程序或系统驱动程序正确地利用了显卡的加速功能。在某些情况下，如果应用程序没有针对GPU加速进行优化，那么2D图形处理仍然会依赖于CPU。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":383900,"user_name":"Geek_88604f","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1501234,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"33DD1318E53814","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1699921560,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"1.三维图形渲染过程，顶点处理、图元处理、栅格化、片段处理以及像素操作这 5 个步骤。\n    2.这些步骤是固定的，数据之间没有依赖，可以并行执行。因此可以用专门的硬件来完成","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":337661,"user_name":"Geek_23e324","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1648198,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8E6A16D9FAF444","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKLkFXq7dy9GUuWibibss2PxKtDN3HSDsQW5MwFkH9guwictzkBt50LmSPjaCtJMMxTo5sia8UjX7pLoQ/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1646962534,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100026001,"comment_content":"5400万为啥会等于54M","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1232589,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/ce/cd/3753de4d.jpg","nickname":"爱与自由","note":"","ucode":"8139E654B7A412","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},